# Android patch series for libplacebo, migrated from edde746/libmpv-android
# buildscripts/patches/libplacebo. One pool filename per line; order is
# authoritative and nothing is sorted.
#
# Shared with series.linux. There is no series.common: apple consumes a
# prebuilt libplacebo, so a common series would claim a patch the apple group
# never applies.
0002-opengl-enable-ubos-on-gles.patch
